cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "lagprotest: Lagged Procrustean Randomization Test for Multivariate Time Series"
abstract: >-
  R package that extends the Procrustean randomization test (PROTEST) to
  ordered multivariate series. Concordance between two configurations is
  scanned across candidate temporal lags, and significance at each lag is
  assessed by permutation, either by cyclic shifts of the full series or by
  free permutation of rows. Returns the lag profile, the lag of maximal
  concordance and per-observation Procrustes residuals.
authors:
